apter is used to collaborate with people, create, update and retrieve Files, Folders, Lists and List Items effectively to meet the specific needs and enables automatic data integration.The adapter is available only for certain service plans of the SAP Integration Suite. For more information, see SAP Note <a href=\\"https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/notes/3188446\\" rel=\\"nofollow\\">3188446</a></p>\\n<p><strong>Product Features:</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n <li>Create Folders</li>\\n <li>Create Lists</li>\\n <li>Create List items</li>\\n <li>Update Columns</li>\\n <li>Download Files</li>\\n <li>Upload Files</li>\\n <li>Create Content Types</li>\\n <li>Retrieve Site information</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n <li>Oauth2 Authorization Code.</li>\\n <li>OAuth2 Client Credentials.</li>\\n <li>Dynamic header and property support in the receiver adapter.</li>\\n <li>Desired response type from SharePoint (JSON or XML).</li>\\n</ul></p>","shortText":"Microsoft SharePoint adapter is used to create and manage Files, Folders, Lists and List Items in SharePoint application by SAP Cloud Integration.","version":"1.0.3","vendor":"SAP","mode":"READ_ONLY","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"r.mohan@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1738927290466","modifiedDate":"1738927290482","createdBy":"r.mohan@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"Microsoft,MicrosoftSharePoint,SAPCloudPlatformIntegration,SAPCloudPlatformIntegrationSuite","keywords":"Adapter,Adapter for SAP,Integration Suite,Microsoft SharePoint,Microsoft SharePoint Adapter,Microsoft SharePoint Suite,SAP Integration Suite,Suite","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"customTags":[],"ResourceId":"ee33ef8e4d5c445bb566a31736d3bda9","PartnerContent":false,"UpdateAvailable":true,"PackageContent":null,"ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts":{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com:443/api/v1/IntegrationPackages(\'MicrosoftSharePointAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite\')/ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts"}}},{"id":"MicrosoftTeamsAdapterforSAPIntegrationSuite","name":"Microsoft Teams Adapter for SAP Integration Suite","description":"<p><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\">The Microsoft Teams adapter facilitates and accelerates the implementation time and reduces the complexity of connecting to Microsoft Teams. The adapter is available only for Standard service plans and above of the SAP Integration Suite. For more information, see SAP Note&nbsp;<a href=\\"https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/notes/3188446\\" rel=\\"nofollow\\">3188446</a>.</span></p>\\n<ul>\\n <li style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\"><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\">Supports standard operations for various Microsoft Teams resources like&nbsp;</span><strong>Channel</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\">, </span><strong>Team</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\">, </span><strong>Member</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\">, </span><strong>Message</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\">, and </span><strong>Chat</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\">.</span></span></li>\\n <li style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\">Supports secure and reliable authentication methods:&nbsp;<strong>OAuth2 Authorization Code</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\"> and </span><strong>OAuth2 Client Credentials</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\">.</span></span></li>\\n <li style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\">Supports&nbsp;<strong>querying</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\"><strong> </strong>on resources to retrieve the </span>desired output<span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\"> as per your requirements.</span></span></li>\\n <li style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\">Supports&nbsp;<strong>pagination</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\"><strong> </strong>using the </span><strong>Get next results page</strong> <span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\">operation.</span></span></li>\\n <li style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\">Flexibility to perform operations at the user level (<strong>Delegated Permission</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\">) and organization/admin level (</span><strong>Application Permission</strong><span style=\\"font-weight: normal\\">).</span></span></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\"><strong>Documentation:</strong></span></p>\\n<p><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\">All documentation, including the User Guide, and Release Notes are included in the documentation tab of this package.</span></p>\\n<p><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\"><strong>Download Location:</strong></span></p>\\n<p><span style=\\"font-size: 10pt\\">&nbsp;To install the Adapter, refer to the Adapter Guide located in the Documents tab.</span></p>","shortText":"This package includes the Microsoft Teams Adapter and its documentation. The Microsoft Teams Adapter is available on SAP Integration Suite. It facilitates and accelerates implementation time and reduces the complexity of connecting to Microsoft Teams.","version":"1.0.0","vendor":"SAP","mode":"READ_ONLY","supportedPlatform":"Cloud Integration","modifiedBy":"r.mohan@sierradigitalinc.com","creationDate":"1762862145583","modifiedDate":"1762862145589","createdBy":"r.mohan@sierradigitalinc.com","products":"MicrosoftTeams","keywords":"","countries":"","industries":"","lineOfBusiness":"","integrationDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"valueMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"messageMappingDesigntimeArtifacts":[],"customTags":[],"ResourceId":"dbef64f7444b48ab998db15338d106de","PartnerContent":false,"UpdateAvailable":false,"PackageContent":null,"ScriptCollectionDesigntimeArtifacts":{"__deferred":{"uri":"https://hess-test-btdpygoi.it-cpi019.cfapps.us10-002.hana.ondemand.com: